WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.050
Here's the code.

2
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:04.700
The template has a header with
the banner, then the parameters:

3
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.566
a workspace picker and nine text values,
from the emergency access accounts to the

4
00:00:09.566 --> 00:00:14.575
synchronization servers and the domain
controllers, all left empty in the template.

5
00:00:14.575 --> 00:00:16.454
Then one tab per daily check,

6
00:00:16.454 --> 00:00:21.520
and one group per tab that shows when
its tab is selected, holding the banner,

7
00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:26.095
the daily check, what to do, the link-outs
with click paths, the G C C note,

8
00:00:26.095 --> 00:00:30.425
and its queries, each one a Logs
query on the workspace parameter.

9
00:00:30.425 --> 00:00:36.510
The validator runs ten checks: the format,
one tab per check, tables, look-backs,

10
00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:40.084
the workspace, the banner,
link-outs and hosts,

11
00:00:40.084 --> 00:00:44.980
queries per tab kind, the telemetry
list, and no I D's or secrets.
